Recording 2. Mental health is our birthright.

197
00:19:55,540 --> 00:19:58,840
We don't have to learn how to be mentally healthy.

198
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:05,360
It is built into us in the same way that our bodies know how to heal a cut or mend a

199
00:20:05,360 --> 00:20:10,240
broken bone. Mental health can't be learned, only reawakened.

200
00:20:10,820 --> 00:20:15,820
It is like immune system of the body, which under stress or through lack of

201
00:20:15,820 --> 00:20:21,280
nutrition or exercise, can be weakened, but which never leaves us.

202
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:26,720
When we don't understand the value of mental health and we don't know how to gain

203
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:31,140
access to it, mental health will remain hidden from us.

204
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:35,860
Our mental health doesn't go anywhere, like the sun behind a cloud.

205
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:42,520
It can be temporarily hidden from view, but it is fully capable of being restored in

206
00:20:42,520 --> 00:20:47,480
an instant. Mental health is the seed that contains self -esteem,

207
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:52,460
confidence in ourselves, and an ability to trust in our common sense.

208
00:20:53,140 --> 00:20:58,960
It allows us to have perspective on our lives, the ability to not take ourselves too

209
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:04,580
seriously, to laugh at ourselves, to see the bigger picture, and to see that things

210
00:21:04,580 --> 00:21:05,660
will work out.

211
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:09,840
It's a form of innate or unlearned optimism.

212
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:15,440
Mental health allows us to view others with sympathy, if they are having troubles,

213
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:21,300
with kindness if they are in pain, and with unconditional love, no matter who they

214
00:21:21,300 --> 00:21:26,980
are. Mental health is the source of creativity for solving problems, resolving

215
00:21:26,980 --> 00:21:29,920
conflict, making our surroundings more beautiful,

216
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:36,120
managing our home life, or coming up with a creative business idea or invention to

217
00:21:36,120 --> 00:21:37,400
make our lives easier.

218
00:21:38,180 --> 00:21:44,840
It gives us patience for ourselves and toward others, as well as while driving,

219
00:21:45,220 --> 00:21:49,120
catching a fish, working on our car, or raising a child.

220
00:21:49,760 --> 00:21:55,300
It allows us to see the beauty that surrounds us each moment in nature, in culture,

221
00:21:55,700 --> 00:21:57,800
in the flow of our daily lives.

222
00:21:58,420 --> 00:22:07,240
Although mental health is the cure -all for living our lives, it is direct you

223
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:09,500
through all your difficult decisions.

224
00:22:10,040 --> 00:22:15,140
Mental health has commonly been called conscience, instinct, wisdom,

225
00:22:15,840 --> 00:22:18,240
common sense, or the inner voice.

226
00:22:18,740 --> 00:22:23,480
We think of it simply as a healthy and helpful flow of intelligent thought.

227
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:29,120
As you will come to see, knowing that mental health is always available, and knowing

228
00:22:29,120 --> 00:22:34,980
to trust it, allow us to slow down to the moment and live life happily.

