Understanding what you are like, what you value, and what kind of person you want to

239
00:24:00,260 --> 00:24:03,860
become is This foundation for all career planning.

240
00:24:04,740 --> 00:24:10,640
In studying yourself, you examine your strengths and weaknesses, your goals, and the

241
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:12,620
trends in your personal development.

242
00:24:13,580 --> 00:24:18,620
The self -understanding that you gain enables you to imagine how certain occupations

243
00:24:18,620 --> 00:24:23,680
may best fit your personality, interests, abilities, and goals.

244
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:30,380
All career decisions require us to learn both about ourselves and about work, and to

245
00:24:30,380 --> 00:24:32,780
integrate these two kinds of knowledge.

246
00:24:33,760 --> 00:24:36,920
Make a list of short and long -term career goals.

247
00:24:37,820 --> 00:24:42,060
Consider your individual skills, talents, interests, and hobbies.

248
00:24:42,580 --> 00:24:48,680
You may realize that your daily struggle with new technologies is a source of

249
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:57,080
progress. Assign a time frame to each goal.

250
00:24:57,520 --> 00:25:00,060
Some may be achievable in the near future.

251
00:25:00,580 --> 00:25:03,060
Others may require years of efforts.

252
00:25:03,720 --> 00:25:09,180
Many will probably lead to a series of goals that you must accomplish over time to

253
00:25:09,180 --> 00:25:11,300
reach your desired end result.

254
00:25:12,020 --> 00:25:18,060
If your ultimate goal is to have a managerial role, you may need to become a trainer

255
00:25:18,060 --> 00:25:20,400
first, then a supervisor.

256
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:26,420
Add specific action steps to your plan that will help you to achieve each goal.

257
00:25:26,940 --> 00:25:31,760
Research classes that may help you become more familiar with new technologies.

258
00:25:32,220 --> 00:25:37,340
Make a list of classes that you want to take, and then schedule a time to meet with

259
00:25:37,340 --> 00:25:42,520
your manager to discuss opportunities for pursuing this type of education.

260
00:25:43,180 --> 00:25:48,420
Write a detailed description of your end goals for each year over the next five

261
00:25:48,420 --> 00:25:54,460
years. By the end of the first year, you may want to have a few successful projects

262
00:25:54,460 --> 00:25:55,440
under your belt.

263
00:25:55,960 --> 00:26:00,880
As the second year comes to a close, you might want to be promoted to a higher

264
00:26:00,880 --> 00:26:03,180
position and so on.

265
00:26:03,500 --> 00:26:08,840
Be clear about the changes that you want to see happen, when they should take place,

266
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:12,680
and what steps you will take to get where you want to be.

267
00:26:13,600 --> 00:26:18,560
Career planning does not guarantee that all the problems, difficulties, or decision

268
00:26:18,560 --> 00:26:24,800
-making situations that you face in the future will be solved, nor can any formula

269
00:26:24,800 --> 00:26:26,220
be given to do that.

270
00:26:26,220 --> 00:26:31,800
But career planning should help you to approach and cope better with new problems,

271
00:26:32,060 --> 00:26:37,040
such as whether or not to enter educational or training programs,

272
00:26:37,700 --> 00:26:42,760
deciding whether or not to change jobs, and analyzing the difficulties you are

273
00:26:42,760 --> 00:26:46,180
having with a situation or a person.

